      "content": "the weight doesn't feel like an illusion, julian. it feels so real. it feels like the very walls are closing in on me. i look at the gardens, the rot, the decay... and i think maybe the rot is more honest than the life we're trying to force here. it would be so easy to just... stop fighting. to just let the darkness take it all. wouldn't that be more peaceful? than this constant, aching struggle?",
